<section class="py-section-padding bg-surface-container-lowest border-y border-surface-variant">
    <div class="max-w-container-max-width mx-auto px-gutter">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded border border-surface-variant hover:border-primary-container transition-colors group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary-container/20 transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-2xl">lock</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white mb-3">Criptografia HTTPS</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Transferência segura de ponta a ponta. Suas rotinas são encriptadas em repouso e em trânsito, garantindo integridade máxima.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded border border-surface-variant hover:border-primary-container transition-colors group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary-container/20 transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-2xl">shield</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white mb-3">Proteção de IP</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Impeça o roubo de código. Distribua rotinas LISP de forma compilada ou ofuscada, controlando o acesso à fonte.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded border border-surface-variant hover:border-primary-container transition-colors group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container-highest flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary-container/20 transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-2xl">cloud_sync</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white mb-3">Acesso Direto</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Integração nativa. Carregue rotinas diretamente da nuvem para o ambiente CAD sem etapas intermediárias complexas.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
